{"data":{"codec":"utf8","content_ref":"inline:The claim in SRC_004 contradicts the exhaustive search described in SCR_008 by assuming that only a restricted case (like p^20) could potentially lead to the sum 2448, which ignores the p^6 * q^2 possibility. This contradiction is refuted if the p^20 case is mathematically proven to be impossible within the given n < 10,000 constraint.","id":"9e88eab3d9d8d557d6283b202e79fe581263761ec376a91224ffee04b27d67ec","interface":{"commitments":["hv-floor@2a45b7988522","lineage-ref@38cbe8b5d67d","relation-form@578e42df713e"],"refs":[{"role":"dependence","target":"1342b4a1c1e2553532861bb57efcc51448323935fa9cb2b479f5e7f9752e949f"},{"role":"dependence","target":"33d6dabff225ff11d883a1274e729ea534b4aed511672c13ecbb91466793c022"},{"role":"dependence","target":"382e2e22a63e87c739508c158588b765a830812724db0c837b3d807056bd4f67"},{"role":"dependence","target":"79a66b08f6979384b185f661cd0cc85f0dc5f3971d95ffc157565aae2cc19833"},{"role":"dependence","target":"d075f37b64e6ed1563f03480ad2d5c8dcc99e340bc287777b5305c641c5a2e3f"}]},"provenance":{"event_seq":1258,"role":"conjecturer","school":"school-0"},"warrants":[]},"id":"9e88eab3d9d8d557d6283b202e79fe581263761ec376a91224ffee04b27d67ec","schema":"artifact"}